WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:00.700
Hey kids!

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.090
Have you heard about this place?

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.520
The Devil's Throat is the big horseshoe in the middle!

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.500
Whoosh! Hear that water roar!

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:09.850
The river keeps flowing.
